          "heading": "Fiji Men's Sevens team partners with Coca-Cola on collectable cans",
          "body": "The Fiji Men's Sevens squad is set to be featured on limited-edition Coca-Cola cans and bottles across the country. Officially launched at Albert Park in Suva, the commemorative collectable packs celebrate eight memorable moments from the national side's 2025 campaigns at the Hong Kong and Singapore tournaments. Fiji Rugby commercial director Tevita Tuiloa welcomed the initiative, noting: 'It is about celebrating our partnership, our shared memories and the special relationship between rugby and the people of Fiji.' The campaign aims to inspire young players nationwide."
