          "kicker": "HISTORIC HONOUR",
          "heading": "France 1977 Grand Slam side joins elite list of inspiring teams",
          "body": "The legendary France team of 1977 has secured a place in rugby history as one of the game's most inspiring sides. The Grand Slam-winning line-up, renowned for sending 'a shiver down the spine' before kick-off, leads a prestigious list of iconic teams celebrated for capturing fans' imaginations. Featuring iconic names such as Jean-Pierre Rives and Jean-Claude Skrela, this feared French outfit remains the benchmark for national spirit."
