          "body": "The Pumas were left frustrated in the Nations Championship after a dramatic 31-24 defeat against England. In a chaotic third-round encounter, the hosts fell just short after a controversial late TMO decision ruled out a last-gasp try that would have offered a chance to salvage the match. The result leaves Argentina with one victory and two defeats from their first three matches of the tournament as they look ahead to their November clash against Ireland."
