          "kicker": "Team selection",
          "heading": "Les Kiss keeps Joseph Suaalii on wing for Bledisloe Cup opener",
          "body": "Wallabies head coach Les Kiss has made only one change to his starting line-up for Saturday’s Bledisloe Cup Test against the All Blacks at Eden Park, bringing rookie Isaac Henry into the centres. Hunter Paisami’s suspension opens the door for Henry, while league convert Joseph Suaalii remains on the wing. Kiss has reverted to a 5-3 bench split, declaring, \"Keeping consistency in the starting side gives us a solid foundation, while adding some freshness on the bench will provide energy late in the game.\""
